✔ verified accounts isolate wardrobes and photos, handle conflicts, recover and delete themselves (14509.9884ms)
✔ image-work semaphore bounds concurrency, queue and wait, and always releases (4208.8103ms)
✔ upload inspection rejects by header metadata before any decode (392.42ms)
✔ limits are configurable and size is judged on decoded bytes (194.9332ms)
✔ a burst of oversize and over-quota uploads is refused cheaply and boundedly (298.9217ms)
✔ consistent backup excludes temporary photos and restore preserves account deletions (19947.8542ms)
