✔ the lock module: a second holder is refused while the first lives (same process too), granted after release, and the coordinator file is guarded (362.8459ms)
✔ a LIVE owner whose main thread is blocked for a long time keeps its lock and its partial and completes (the first 009 failure) (12744.2728ms)
✔ publication never replaces an existing backup, even when the name is taken at the last moment (1023.5323ms)
